  delegation policy that bulk PR work goes through codex — tell me if you'd
  rather those be grok as well. Two more caveats: if the live fleet has
  [97mDM_GITHUB_AGENT_PROVIDER[39m/[97m_MODEL[39m set in its env, the code default won't take
  effect until those are cleared; and this ships only when the branch merges and
  the live worktree redeploys.

  Everything is on the branch/PR, nothing is armed against the live fleet. To
  turn on the auto-maintenance after merge: deploy, ensure
  [97mDM_SCHEDULED_AGENT_PUMP_ENABLED=1[39m, then [97mPOST /api/fleet/skills-upstream/setup[39m.

